1
00:00:13,805 --> 00:00:15,223
My dear friend,

2
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:17,183
Dio's bone.

3
00:00:18,059 --> 00:00:20,103
What's happening?

4
00:00:20,186 --> 00:00:23,481
Where is the bone?

5
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:26,651
Where is his bone? Now tell me!

6
00:00:28,027 --> 00:00:32,699
I feel the bone's presence
from the Ultra Security House Unit.

7
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:35,493
Then Jolyne got punished on purpose

8
00:00:35,577 --> 00:00:39,914
so that she gets confined at
the Disciplinary Wing to find the bone!

9
00:00:39,998 --> 00:00:42,667
Yes. But it's too reckless.

10
00:00:42,751 --> 00:00:47,338
If I can obtain the bone first,
Pale Snake will come after me.

11
00:00:47,422 --> 00:00:50,175
And with him,

12
00:00:50,258 --> 00:00:53,386
my father's stolen memory disc
in his hand!

13
00:01:00,393 --> 00:01:01,686
That small man…

14
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:03,438
I must find him.

15
00:01:03,521 --> 00:01:05,774
He has the bone!

16
00:01:06,816 --> 00:01:08,485
Is he hiding somewhere?

17
00:01:09,027 --> 00:01:11,696
What if someone gets
that small man before I do?

18
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:15,909
I must obtain the bone
before I lose it again.

19
00:01:26,211 --> 00:01:29,798
What happened here?

20
00:01:29,881 --> 00:01:32,509
They are already done fighting.

21
00:01:33,218 --> 00:01:37,764
And everyone in the Disciplinary Wing
is abnormally bloated.

22
00:01:38,264 --> 00:01:39,516
It's a Stand.

23
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:43,520
How many other Stand Users were sent here?

24
00:01:47,232 --> 00:01:48,942
Are they the ones who did this?

25
00:01:49,734 --> 00:01:51,986
Just what exactly did they do?

26
00:01:54,948 --> 00:01:58,034
No, one User only has one Stand.

27
00:01:58,118 --> 00:02:02,831
These prisoners were defeated by
just one of these two guys.

28
00:02:03,414 --> 00:02:07,836
How many other Stand Users were
sent to this Disciplinary Wing?

29
00:02:08,419 --> 00:02:10,839
At the least, there is one more User

30
00:02:10,922 --> 00:02:14,092
who manipulates others into fighting
by stimulating their minds.

31
00:02:19,722 --> 00:02:23,226
Can you stand with that injury of yours?

32
00:02:24,769 --> 00:02:29,315
That thread Stand of yours was
most fascinating.

33
00:02:30,358 --> 00:02:35,321
Especially since it's impossible
to predict its next move.

34
00:02:35,822 --> 00:02:39,951
Even more intriguing, though,
is your mental strength.

35
00:02:40,618 --> 00:02:42,495
Despite the damage to your body,

36
00:02:42,579 --> 00:02:46,749
I can sense the growth you've had
since the last battle.

37
00:02:47,333 --> 00:02:54,048
When Pale Snake said he would send
four Stand Users, including myself,

38
00:02:54,549 --> 00:02:57,927
I questioned his judgment for sending
such an excessive number of us.

39
00:02:59,262 --> 00:03:02,140
But now, I understand him a little better.

40
00:03:02,223 --> 00:03:06,144
Especially since he wishes
to finish you off completely.

41
00:03:07,186 --> 00:03:11,399
I am Kenzou, 78 years old.

42
00:03:11,482 --> 00:03:14,986
The secret to my longevity is
eight and a half hours of sleep a day

43
00:03:15,069 --> 00:03:18,114
and my daily "urine therapy,"
with just one cup every morning.

44
00:03:18,197 --> 00:03:21,034
The important thing is
to keep the habit going.

45
00:03:21,534 --> 00:03:24,537
Have you heard of "urine therapy"?

46
00:03:29,334 --> 00:03:32,712
If you want a fight, I won't back down.

47
00:03:33,671 --> 00:03:34,964
American-style.

48
00:03:35,673 --> 00:03:36,799
French-style.

49
00:03:38,051 --> 00:03:39,469
Japanese-style.

50
00:03:40,511 --> 00:03:42,597
Italian-style, specifically Naples.

51
00:03:43,514 --> 00:03:46,809
Those are "fuck you" gestures
from around the globe.

52
00:05:18,943 --> 00:05:21,112
I will start by telling
you the conclusion.

53
00:05:21,195 --> 00:05:24,073
These prisoners drowned to death.

54
00:05:24,157 --> 00:05:29,329
I drowned them,
so their bodies are bloated like that.

55
00:05:30,872 --> 00:05:36,210
And it seems that
I won't be facing you just yet.

56
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:43,634
F.F.!

57
00:05:49,932 --> 00:05:51,059
Shit.

58
00:05:51,142 --> 00:05:54,645
He knew I was sneaking up
on him from the bloated bodies.

59
00:05:54,729 --> 00:05:56,481
My preemptive strike failed.

60
00:05:56,564 --> 00:06:00,526
Not only that, but that bloated corpse
got in the way of my F.F. gun.

61
00:06:01,652 --> 00:06:03,529
Close call.

62
00:06:03,613 --> 00:06:05,698
F.F., how did you get in here?

63
00:06:05,782 --> 00:06:07,450
I made it in the nick of time.

64
00:06:07,533 --> 00:06:10,870
Looks like you're in some deep shit.

65
00:06:10,953 --> 00:06:14,248
I'll fill up your wounds in a second.

66
00:06:23,716 --> 00:06:25,885
That man… who was he again?

67
00:06:26,552 --> 00:06:31,849
Right, he was at Emporio's hideout
with Weather Forecast.

68
00:06:31,933 --> 00:06:37,980
Before I heal you, Jolyne,
I'll take care of this geezer!

69
00:06:42,693 --> 00:06:47,865
Southeast, 127 degrees,
30 minutes, and 20 seconds.

70
00:06:50,868 --> 00:06:51,744
Their sweat…

71
00:06:54,038 --> 00:06:55,164
It will drip.

72
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:58,835
Will they open their mouth?

73
00:07:04,715 --> 00:07:06,509
Do you want to drown?

74
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:07,885
Drown?

75
00:07:07,969 --> 00:07:12,306
I don't know what your plans are,
but I sure love water.

76
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:13,516
See if it works on me--

77
00:07:17,687 --> 00:07:20,148
The time it takes for humans
to drown in water

78
00:07:20,231 --> 00:07:23,985
is between five to seven minutes
for those who have been trained.

79
00:07:24,068 --> 00:07:29,198
That's only if there's air
left in the lungs.

80
00:07:29,282 --> 00:07:33,119
But let's say all the air is sucked out
from both lungs.

81
00:07:33,202 --> 00:07:34,579
In this condition,

82
00:07:34,662 --> 00:07:40,084
humans drown to death instantly
with a mere few drops of water!

83
00:07:40,168 --> 00:07:42,753
I directly struck

84
00:07:42,837 --> 00:07:46,007
your fourth cervical vertebra
by going through your throat.

85
00:07:46,090 --> 00:07:48,885
It contains nerves
connected to your kidney.

86
00:07:48,968 --> 00:07:50,386
The adrenal gland!

87
00:07:50,470 --> 00:07:53,639
It produces bodily fluids that
lubricate the respiratory system

88
00:07:53,723 --> 00:07:56,142
like oil does to an engine.

89
00:07:56,225 --> 00:07:57,852
Even a few drops of water

90
00:07:57,935 --> 00:08:02,565
will make you feel as if you are being
swallowed up in a giant wave!

91
00:08:04,942 --> 00:08:07,111
I can't breathe!

92
00:08:07,195 --> 00:08:11,240
Right now, I'm in the body
of an average human, Atroe.

93
00:08:11,324 --> 00:08:14,202
This is bad, this body won't last!

94
00:08:16,746 --> 00:08:18,122
F.F.!

95
00:08:24,253 --> 00:08:26,631
Do you want to drown too?

96
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:31,010
Jolyne Cujoh!

97
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:45,316
I have you!

98
00:08:49,904 --> 00:08:52,114
What are you?

99
00:08:52,198 --> 00:08:53,449
Are you really human?

100
00:08:57,119 --> 00:08:58,204
Don't stand.

101
00:08:58,829 --> 00:09:01,707
Just observe them from here for now.

102
00:09:02,291 --> 00:09:09,173
Shouldn't you be assessing
what kind of Stand User that geezer is?

103
00:09:10,132 --> 00:09:15,888
The problem here is not that
he drowned those prisoners,

104
00:09:16,889 --> 00:09:19,058
but that he dodged every bullet.

105
00:09:19,725 --> 00:09:24,313
It may seem insignificant,
but how did he do that?

106
00:09:24,397 --> 00:09:26,607
That's more dangerous, don't you think?

107
00:09:26,691 --> 00:09:29,485
What brought you here?

108
00:09:29,569 --> 00:09:32,196
Your name is Anastasia, right?

109
00:09:33,573 --> 00:09:37,994
I love you.
I couldn't wait to be here with you.

110
00:09:40,037 --> 00:09:42,206
Say what now?

111
00:09:44,625 --> 00:09:48,921
That old man has been incarcerated
here for 40 years now.

112
00:09:49,005 --> 00:09:51,799
He's an idiot who drinks his own piss.

113
00:09:52,341 --> 00:09:55,136
I thought I hadn't seen him
at the male wing for a while,

114
00:09:55,219 --> 00:09:57,263
but who would've guessed he was here?

115
00:09:57,346 --> 00:10:00,141
Even worse, he now has a Stand.

116
00:10:00,224 --> 00:10:01,517
In the autumn of 1969,

117
00:10:01,601 --> 00:10:06,606
this geezer killed 34 people,
all young men and women.

118
00:10:06,689 --> 00:10:09,108
His sentence is for 280 years.

119
00:10:11,652 --> 00:10:14,947
Though he's old now, he was 37
when he received his sentence.

120
00:10:15,573 --> 00:10:17,908
He was the self-proclaimed
founder of a cult.

121
00:10:17,992 --> 00:10:22,204
His sect was so popular
that even Hollywood stars joined it.

122
00:10:22,788 --> 00:10:27,418
However, his cult's activities
clashed with society,

123
00:10:27,501 --> 00:10:29,879
 so the police and the FBI intervened.

124
00:10:30,379 --> 00:10:32,340
Cornered,

125
00:10:32,423 --> 00:10:35,801
this geezer locked himself
and 34 of his followers

126
00:10:35,885 --> 00:10:38,054
in an estate here in Florida.

127
00:10:38,721 --> 00:10:40,890
He attempted to burn everyone to death.

128
00:10:41,641 --> 00:10:46,771
Kenzou drugged every follower
and set the building on fire.

129
00:10:46,854 --> 00:10:53,027
All the believers burned to death,
but the founder survived.

130
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,322
Strangely enough,

131
00:10:56,405 --> 00:11:00,701
it so happened that
a part of the wall collapsed on him,

132
00:11:00,785 --> 00:11:03,120
protecting him from the smoke and fire.

133
00:11:03,204 --> 00:11:05,665
He was barely alive when he was rescued.

134
00:11:05,748 --> 00:11:08,250
There's no doubt he intended to die.

135
00:11:09,126 --> 00:11:11,545
What am I trying to say?

136
00:11:11,629 --> 00:11:12,755
Who knows.

137
00:11:12,838 --> 00:11:14,674
I can't say for myself.

138
00:11:14,757 --> 00:11:17,093
Either way, Kenzou alone survived.

139
00:11:17,176 --> 00:11:20,971
He cannot leave this prison,
but he wasn't put to death, either.

140
00:11:21,555 --> 00:11:23,557
These are the facts surrounding this man.

141
00:11:26,852 --> 00:11:32,233
I don't know what you are,
but I can tell your strongest power.

142
00:11:32,316 --> 00:11:35,069
The secrets to your strength, yes.

143
00:11:35,653 --> 00:11:39,782
I can clearly sense something else
other than blood

144
00:11:39,865 --> 00:11:41,534
running through your veins.

145
00:11:41,617 --> 00:11:43,619
Is that your Stand?

146
00:11:43,702 --> 00:11:46,580
Or are you an entirely different being?

147
00:11:46,664 --> 00:11:49,625
Those things do not change your weakness.

148
00:11:49,708 --> 00:11:52,461
Your weak points and body structure

149
00:11:52,545 --> 00:11:57,925
are the same as any other human,
including the blood flowing within you.

150
00:11:59,969 --> 00:12:03,013
Do you want to drown again?

151
00:12:03,097 --> 00:12:05,349
This time, you will not survive.

152
00:12:07,017 --> 00:12:10,855
Southwest, 225 degrees, 0 minutes.

153
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:16,360
He made something appear
in his hands again.

154
00:12:16,444 --> 00:12:17,820
What is that?

155
00:12:17,903 --> 00:12:20,906
And what is his weird footwork for?

156
00:12:22,908 --> 00:12:26,537
Let's see the direction of your dragon.

157
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:38,466
F.F., it's behind you!

158
00:12:41,051 --> 00:12:42,011
Wrong.

159
00:12:42,094 --> 00:12:45,723
It's useless, so stop attacking me!

160
00:12:54,273 --> 00:12:55,983
STAND NAME: DRAKE'S DREAM
STAND MASTER: KENZOU

161
00:12:59,278 --> 00:13:00,362
Wrong.

162
00:13:00,446 --> 00:13:03,866
It's useless. So stop attacking me.

163
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:10,623
I said, your enemy is the geezer!

164
00:13:10,706 --> 00:13:12,291
You don't listen, do you?

165
00:13:12,374 --> 00:13:14,418
I don't pick sides.

166
00:13:14,502 --> 00:13:17,213
Your attacks will only pass through me.

167
00:13:17,296 --> 00:13:19,423
Face forward! You better watch out.

168
00:13:19,507 --> 00:13:20,674
The geezer's coming for you!

169
00:13:21,425 --> 00:13:24,053
I have no right to butt in.

170
00:13:24,136 --> 00:13:26,096
Mind you, the geezer.

171
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,224
The geezer is your enemy.

172
00:13:28,307 --> 00:13:29,934
This dragon!

173
00:13:30,017 --> 00:13:33,938
Is this dragon's ability allowing
Kenzou to dodge my bullets?

174
00:13:34,021 --> 00:13:35,648
And here he comes.

175
00:13:41,987 --> 00:13:43,489
This speed…

176
00:13:43,572 --> 00:13:46,075
Those don't seem like
punches from a 78-year-old.

177
00:13:46,158 --> 00:13:48,702
Now I can enter the dragon.

178
00:13:58,629 --> 00:14:00,381
What's going on?

179
00:14:00,965 --> 00:14:03,425
What did he do to his own arm?

180
00:14:06,512 --> 00:14:09,682
His arm flew behind F.F.'s head!

181
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:15,771
That was close.

182
00:14:15,854 --> 00:14:19,108
But they blocked his attack
in their own weird way.

183
00:14:19,191 --> 00:14:24,613
His arm disappeared
the moment he touched that dragon Stand.

184
00:14:25,197 --> 00:14:27,700
Does it conceal
the direction of his next strike?

185
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:36,250
What is that dragon-like thing?

186
00:14:36,333 --> 00:14:39,128
Does your arm fly off
when you touch that dragon?

187
00:14:39,211 --> 00:14:41,463
You still punch like an
old geezer, though.

188
00:14:41,547 --> 00:14:43,591
Wrong, F.F.

189
00:14:43,674 --> 00:14:45,843
I can already see what will happen.

190
00:14:45,926 --> 00:14:49,889
But no one else can predict it.

191
00:14:50,389 --> 00:14:54,393
Don't say unnecessary things!
Stop your yapping.

192
00:14:54,476 --> 00:14:56,270
You are supposed to stay neutral!

193
00:14:56,353 --> 00:14:58,480
You're keeping it to yourself,
that's not fair!

194
00:14:58,564 --> 00:15:00,524
Just tell them!

195
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:29,553
You opened your mouth.

196
00:15:34,767 --> 00:15:36,435
F.F.!

197
00:15:37,186 --> 00:15:39,396
Was that a coincidence just now?

198
00:15:39,897 --> 00:15:44,443
That prisoner's glasses flew up
and stabbed F.F's face!

199
00:15:44,526 --> 00:15:46,695
Unlucky direction.

200
00:15:47,196 --> 00:15:48,697
I'm starting to understand it.

201
00:15:48,781 --> 00:15:50,532
He's using feng shui.

202
00:15:51,408 --> 00:15:54,036
There is a principle called feng shui
in East Asia.

203
00:15:54,119 --> 00:15:57,665
Kenzou's footsteps pointing to
cardinal directions indicate it.

204
00:15:57,748 --> 00:16:03,420
As if predetermined, he advances
his attacks from one direction.

205
00:16:03,504 --> 00:16:06,423
Furthermore, the Stand in his hands…

206
00:16:06,507 --> 00:16:11,553
Kenzou uses that dragon-like Stand
to choose his direction of attack.

207
00:16:11,637 --> 00:16:12,846
Feng shui?

208
00:16:12,930 --> 00:16:14,098
What's that?

209
00:16:14,181 --> 00:16:16,016
Direction of attack?

210
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,810
Feng shui.

211
00:16:17,893 --> 00:16:22,231
It's a divination method much like
tarot card reading and astrology,

212
00:16:22,314 --> 00:16:23,899
except it's not fortune-telling.

213
00:16:23,983 --> 00:16:25,526
According to Eastern philosophy,

214
00:16:25,609 --> 00:16:28,988
there are natural forms of energy such as
wind energy and water energy

215
00:16:29,071 --> 00:16:30,864
flowing through mountains and valleys.

216
00:16:31,699 --> 00:16:36,912
The flow of such energy is used
to guide one's life.

217
00:16:37,621 --> 00:16:39,039
For example, feng shui is used

218
00:16:39,123 --> 00:16:42,960
to determine the luck found
in an area, house, and even a room.

219
00:16:43,502 --> 00:16:46,046
If the land or house faces
an unlucky direction,

220
00:16:46,130 --> 00:16:51,385
it is said to affect the wealth, health,
and fortune of those who live there.

221
00:16:52,344 --> 00:16:53,762
In times of war,

222
00:16:53,846 --> 00:16:58,726
an enemy castle's feng shui was read
to decide which direction to attack from

223
00:16:58,809 --> 00:17:01,603
in order to make the enemy fall.

224
00:17:02,104 --> 00:17:03,605
On the other hand,

225
00:17:03,689 --> 00:17:06,692
temples were built at castles'
unlucky directions

226
00:17:06,775 --> 00:17:08,485
to counteract bad fortune.

227
00:17:09,153 --> 00:17:11,363
This provided
further protection to strongholds.

228
00:17:13,032 --> 00:17:17,995
Not only that, but feng shui's philosophy
is even applied to human anatomy.

229
00:17:18,078 --> 00:17:20,998
There's such thing as
assassination feng shui.

230
00:17:22,124 --> 00:17:23,959
You can use feng shui to determine

231
00:17:24,043 --> 00:17:28,172
the luckiest direction of attack
against a human.

232
00:17:28,672 --> 00:17:31,508
Then, no matter how the opponent
tries to block the advances,

233
00:17:31,592 --> 00:17:36,096
it is possible to approach the target
without letting them in on the offensive.

234
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:38,015
Thus, making the assassination easy.

235
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:42,102
In other words, the unlucky orientation.

236
00:17:42,686 --> 00:17:46,231
Kenzou's Stand must rely
on this principle.

237
00:17:46,315 --> 00:17:49,068
F.F. must fight against
the direction of worst luck.

238
00:17:49,151 --> 00:17:54,198
That dragon Stand points to
the best direction for a killing blow.

239
00:17:54,865 --> 00:17:59,244
When that geezer's attack
overlaps with the dragon's location,

240
00:17:59,328 --> 00:18:02,456
F.F.'s fate is sealed.

241
00:18:02,539 --> 00:18:06,293
Who would've thought that Kenzou
has mastered assassination feng shui

242
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,587
during his 40 years in prison,

243
00:18:08,670 --> 00:18:11,423
manifesting it as his Stand ability!

244
00:18:12,132 --> 00:18:14,635
Feng shui shows the direction
he should take.

245
00:18:15,469 --> 00:18:17,679
The same concept applies for defending.

246
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:22,226
F.F. missed every shot.

247
00:18:22,309 --> 00:18:23,477
That was the reason!

248
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:27,648
It's because feng shui
worked in his favor and protected him.

249
00:18:27,731 --> 00:18:28,941
Is that right?

250
00:18:29,024 --> 00:18:30,192
Undoubtedly.

251
00:18:30,275 --> 00:18:36,406
When he has the dragon in his hands,
he can read his safest direction.

252
00:18:36,990 --> 00:18:41,870
After moving to that area,
he then prepares to strike.

253
00:18:42,496 --> 00:18:45,874
The dragon points to
the orientation best for killing.

254
00:18:45,958 --> 00:18:47,042
F.F.!

255
00:18:47,126 --> 00:18:49,920
It wasn't a coincidence that
the glasses hit you!

256
00:18:50,420 --> 00:18:53,632
Don't let Kenzou move toward the dragon!

257
00:18:54,133 --> 00:18:55,801
I don't really understand it,

258
00:18:55,884 --> 00:19:00,430
but you must not
let Kenzou touch the dragon!

259
00:19:01,682 --> 00:19:04,268
Look at that, Drake's Dream!

260
00:19:04,351 --> 00:19:07,604
They figured out my trick
because of your blabbering!

261
00:19:07,688 --> 00:19:09,648
Shut up, old freak.

262
00:19:09,731 --> 00:19:11,817
I'm not your henchman!

263
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:15,320
Feng shui should be open to anyone.

264
00:19:15,404 --> 00:19:19,283
But it's true that the old geezer
benefits most from me.

265
00:19:19,366 --> 00:19:22,369
F.F., this area is your worst luck.

266
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:25,247
Just above your left ear.

267
00:19:25,831 --> 00:19:29,835
This area is the worst weak point for you.

268
00:19:29,918 --> 00:19:33,547
Your lucky color is yellow,
and pictures of goldfish bring you luck.

269
00:19:33,630 --> 00:19:34,923
If you have any, that is.

270
00:19:35,007 --> 00:19:38,260
F.F., he's behind you!

271
00:19:40,387 --> 00:19:42,389
So you'll chop me, will you?

272
00:19:42,472 --> 00:19:45,517
I don't even need to position
myself in the dragon's orientation.

273
00:19:49,938 --> 00:19:53,859
His defensive stance is also an attack.

274
00:19:53,942 --> 00:19:55,694
Must be derived from tai chi.

275
00:19:56,528 --> 00:19:59,114
Your mouth is mine!

276
00:20:03,952 --> 00:20:09,082
Another instance where
the defensive stance is also an attack.

277
00:20:10,417 --> 00:20:12,085
You wench!

278
00:20:12,169 --> 00:20:16,506
Using the dragon's orientation seems to be
the surest path to victory.

279
00:20:23,055 --> 00:20:26,266
I made your hand overlap with the dragon!

280
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:29,937
It works the same as if I attack.

281
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:33,440
Your own arm will now hurt you!

282
00:20:46,161 --> 00:20:50,624
My attack overlapped with
your orientation of death!

283
00:20:51,208 --> 00:20:53,794
Bastard, what did you just do to me?

284
00:20:53,877 --> 00:20:56,380
What did you do with my arm just now?

285
00:20:56,463 --> 00:21:00,300
I just said it's the orientation
for worst luck.

286
00:21:00,384 --> 00:21:02,970
That's the power of orientation for you.

287
00:21:03,053 --> 00:21:07,766
I can't predict what happens next,
and if I were you,

288
00:21:07,849 --> 00:21:11,687
I'd try to reduce the damage to a minimum.

289
00:21:39,006 --> 00:21:41,258
F.F., get away from there!

290
00:21:41,341 --> 00:21:45,679
The meteorites destroyed the supports!
The fan will fall on you!

291
00:21:52,728 --> 00:21:56,398
Oh, the fan isn't your threat.

292
00:21:56,481 --> 00:21:58,066
The boomerang is.

293
00:22:10,245 --> 00:22:13,749
F.F.!

294
00:23:41,419 --> 00:23:46,424
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
